     H option(*nodebugio:*srcstmt)
     H dftactgrp(*no) actgrp(*CALLER)
     H/define CONVERT
     H/TITLE S0501R - SYSTEM COMPANY FILE SEARCH
     H*****************************************************************
     H**                                                             **
     H**   PROGRAM DESCRIPTION:                                      **
     H**     THIS PROGRAM PROVIDES A SEARCH OF THE SYSTEM COMPANY    **
     H**     FILE                                                    **
     H**                                                             **
     H**   CALLED FROM:                                              **
     H**     S0001R                                                  **
     H**   CALLS TO:                                                 **
     H**     M0006C - Help request                                   **
     H**   PROGRAMMER: Lori J. Quinn                                 **
     H**   CREATED:    04/18/91     PROJECT:                         **
     H**                                                             **
     H** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
     H**                                                             **
     H** MODIFICATIONS:                                              **
     H**                                                             **
     H**                                                             **
     H** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
     H**                                                             **
     H** INDICATOR USAGE:                                            **
     H**   INDICATOR            FUNCTION DESCRIPTION                 **
     H**                                                             **
     H**      KC      Command 03 - EXIT                              **
     H**      KL      Command 12 - CANCEL                            **
     H**      18      SCR01  ROLL UP                                 **
     H**      19      SCR01  ROLL DOWN                               **
     H**      20      SCR01  INVALID ROLL                            **
     H**      60      SCR01  CHAIN                                   **
     H**      61      SCR02  FILL SCREEN                             **
     H**  SCR01:                                                     **
     H** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
     H** FILE USAGE:                                                 **
     H** FILES:                                                      **
     H**    S0501F:  Screen Display
     H**    SMCOL (PCO01): CO                                        **
     H*****************************************************************
     FS0501F    CF   E             WORKSTN
      /If Defined (WEB)
     F                                     Handler('PROFOUNDUI(HANDLER)')
      /Endif
     F                                     INFDS(FIDS01)
     FSMCOL     IF   E           K DISK

     D FL              S              1    DIM(14)
     D RR              S              9    DIM(2) CTDATA PERRCD(1)
     D KEY             S              3  0 DIM(2)
     D                 DS
     D  DSDTTM                 1     12  0
     D  DSTIME                 1      6  0
     D  DSDATE                 7     12  0
     D                 DS
     D  XXRECF                 1     10
     D  XXSCR#                 2      5
     D                 DS
     D  CO                     1     42  0
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCCO01                 1      3  0
     D  SCCO02                 4      6  0
     D  SCCO03                 7      9  0
     D  SCCO04                10     12  0
     D  SCCO05                13     15  0
     D  SCCO06                16     18  0
     D  SCCO07                19     21  0
     D  SCCO08                22     24  0
     D  SCCO09                25     27  0
     D  SCCO10                28     30  0
     D  SCCO11                31     33  0
     D  SCCO12                34     36  0
     D  SCCO13                37     39  0
     D  SCCO14                40     42  0
     D                 DS
     D  NM                     1    560
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCNM01                 1     40
     D  SCNM02                41     80
     D  SCNM03                81    120
     D  SCNM04               121    160
     D  SCNM05               161    200
     D  SCNM06               201    240
     D  SCNM07               241    280
     D  SCNM08               281    320
     D  SCNM09               321    360
     D  SCNM10               361    400
     D  SCNM11               401    440
     D  SCNM12               441    480
     D  SCNM13               481    520
     D  SCNM14               521    560
     D                 DS
     D  ST                     1     28
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCST01                 1      2
     D  SCST02                 3      4
     D  SCST03                 5      6
     D  SCST04                 7      8
     D  SCST05                 9     10
     D  SCST06                11     12
     D  SCST07                13     14
     D  SCST08                15     16
     D  SCST09                17     18
     D  SCST10                19     20
     D  SCST11                21     22
     D  SCST12                23     24
     D  SCST13                25     26
     D  SCST14                27     28
     D                 DS
     D  FE                     1    126  0
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCFE01                 1      9  0
     D  SCFE02                10     18  0
     D  SCFE03                19     27  0
     D  SCFE04                28     36  0
     D  SCFE05                37     45  0
     D  SCFE06                46     54  0
     D  SCFE07                55     63  0
     D  SCFE08                64     72  0
     D  SCFE09                73     81  0
     D  SCFE10                82     90  0
     D  SCFE11                91     99  0
     D  SCFE12               100    108  0
     D  SCFE13               109    117  0
     D  SCFE14               118    126  0
     D FIDS01        E DS                  EXTNAME(SZQ2P)
     D PSDS          ESDS                  EXTNAME(SZQ1P)

     C*
     C*   KEY LIST FOR THE COMPANY FILE
     C*
     C     COKEY         KLIST
     C                   KFLD                    XXCO#             3 0
     C*
     C*
     C     *ENTRY        PLIST
     C                   PARM                    QQPRDS           40
     C                   PARM                    QQCALL            1
     C                   PARM                    QQKEY             3 0
     C                   PARM                    QQRTCD            1
     C*
     C*
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        SCUSER
     C                   MOVE      QQPRDS        SCPRDS
     C*
     C*   LOAD THE RECORD FORMAT INFO FOR FIRST TIME
     C*
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        Q2RECF
     C                   MOVEL     'SCR01'       Q2RECF
     C*
     C*   LOAD THE INITIAL SCREEN FROM SELECTED POSITION
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     QQKEY         SCCO#
     C                   GOTO      REPOS
     C*
     C*   DISPLAY ALL FORMATS
     C*
     C     STRT          TAG
     C*
     C     XXUP          IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SCUP
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     RR(1)         SCUP
     C                   END
     C     XXDOWN        IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SCDOWN
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     RR(2)         SCDOWN
     C                   END
     C                   EXFMT     SCR01
     C*
     C*   PROCESS ALL COMMAND KEYS
     C*
     C*
     C     *IN11         IFEQ      '1'
     C*
     C*   COMMAND 03 = END OF JOB
     C*
     C     *INKC         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      'A'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         QQKEY
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C*   COMMAND 12 = PRIOR SCREEN
     C*
     C     *INKL         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      'B'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         QQKEY
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C*   ROLL UP REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN18         CABEQ     '1'           SCR01T
     C*
     C*   ROLL DOWN REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN19         CABEQ     '1'           SCR01T
     C*
     C*   PROCESS HELP REQUESTS
     C*
     C     *IN10         IFEQ      '1'
     C*
     C                   MOVE      Q2RECF        XXRECF           10
     C                   MOVEL     'QHLP    '    FILNAM           10
     C                   MOVEL     '*LIBL   '    LIBNAM           10
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         MBRNAM
     C                   MOVE      XXSCR#        MBRNAM           10
     C                   CALL      'M0006C'
     C                   PARM                    FILNAM
     C                   PARM                    LIBNAM
     C                   PARM                    MBRNAM
     C                   WRITE     SCR99
     C                   MOVE      XXRECF        Q2RECF
     C*
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C                   END
     C*
     C*   GOTO THE APPROPRIATE SCREEN
     C*
     C     Q2RECF        CABEQ     'SCR01'       SCR01T
     C*
     C*   PROCESS REQUEST SCREEN
     C*
     C     SCR01T        TAG
     C*
     C*  INVALID ROLL REQUEST
     C*
     C   18XXUP          IFNE      *BLANK
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *IN20
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C   19XXDOWN        IFNE      *BLANK
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *IN20
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  ROLL UP REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN18         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXDOWN
     C                   Z-ADD     KEY(2)        XXCO#
     C     COKEY         CHAIN     SMCOL                              60
     C                   EXSR      LOAD
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  ROLL DOWN REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN19         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXUP
     C                   Z-ADD     KEY(1)        XXCO#
     C     COKEY         CHAIN     SMCOL                              60
     C                   EXSR      LOADP
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  REPOSITION FILE AT REQUESTED RECORD
     C*
     C     SCCO#         IFNE      *ZERO
     C     REPOS         TAG
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        KEY
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXUP
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXDOWN
     C                   Z-ADD     SCCO#         XXCO#
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        SCCO#
     C     COKEY         SETLL     SMCOL
     C                   READ      SMCOL                                  60
     C                   EXSR      LOAD
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  CHECK CURSOR POSTION
     C*
     C     Q2CPOS        DIV       256           LIN               2 0
     C     LIN           SUB       7             I1                3 0
     C*
     C*  VALID CURSOR POSITION - RETURN WITH NO SELECTION
     C*
     C     I1            IFGE      1
     C     I1            ANDLE     14
     C                   MOVE      '*'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     CO(I1)        QQKEY
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  INVALID CURSOR POSITION - RETURN WITH NO SELECTION
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '*'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         QQKEY
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C*
     C*  END THE PROGRAM
     C*
     C     TERM          TAG
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     C*
     C*  CLEAR SCREEN ARRAYS
     C*
     C     CLR           BEGSR
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       CO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       NM
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       ST
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       FE
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         I1
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN ARRAYS
     C*
     C     FILL          BEGSR
     C                   Z-ADD     COCO#         CO(I1)
     C                   MOVEL     CONAME        NM(I1)
     C                   MOVEL     COST          ST(I1)
     C                   Z-ADD     COFEIN        FE(I1)
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  LOAD FORWARD SUBROUTINE
     C*
     C     LOAD          BEGSR
     C                   EXSR      CLR
     C     OVER          TAG
     C*
     C*  END OF FILE
     C*
     C   60              MOVE      '1'           XXUP              1
     C   60              GOTO      DONE
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   ADD       1             I1
     C                   EXSR      FILL
     C                   READ      SMCOL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXUP
     C                   GOTO      DONE
     C                   END
     C     I1            COMP      14                                   61
     C   61              GOTO      OVER
     C     DONE          TAG
     C                   Z-ADD     CO(1)         KEY(1)
     C                   Z-ADD     CO(14)        KEY(2)
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  LOAD BACKWARD SUBROUTINE
     C*
     C     LOADP         BEGSR
     C                   EXSR      CLR
     C                   Z-ADD     15            I1
     C     OVERP         TAG
     C*
     C*  BEGINNING OF FILE
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   EXSR      LOADB
     C                   GOTO      DONEP
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   SUB       1             I1
     C                   EXSR      FILL
     C                   READP     SMCOL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXDOWN
     C                   GOTO      OVERP
     C                   END
     C     I1            COMP      1                                  61
     C   61              GOTO      OVERP
     C     DONEP         TAG
     C                   Z-ADD     CO(1)         KEY(1)
     C                   Z-ADD     CO(14)        KEY(2)
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  LOAD FROM BEGINNING OF FILE SUBROUTINE
     C*
     C     LOADB         BEGSR
     C                   EXSR      CLR
     C*
     C*  POSITION AT BEGINNING OF FILE
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXDOWN            1
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XXCO#
     C     COKEY         SETLL     SMCOL
     C                   READ      SMCOL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXUP              1
     C                   GOTO      DONEB
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C     OVERB         TAG
     C                   ADD       1             I1
     C                   EXSR      FILL
     C                   READ      SMCOL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXUP
     C                   GOTO      DONEB
     C                   END
     C     I1            COMP      14                                   61
     C   61              GOTO      OVERB
     C     DONEB         ENDSR
**
ROLL UP
ROLL DOWN
